==================================================
0. PRODUCT PURPOSE
==================================================

GTO-SELF is a fast poker training and hand-replay application focused initially on CoinPoker-style 6-max NLHE cash games.

This application is for independent training, simulation, replay, and analysis.

Do NOT integrate with the CoinPoker client.
Do NOT read the CoinPoker screen.
Do NOT automate input from a live poker client.
Do NOT scrape or interact with a poker client.
Do NOT build automated live-play actions.

The user manually enters poker actions into an independent training table.

Primary philosophy:

INPUT -> AUTOMATIC STATE CALCULATION -> STRATEGY LOOKUP -> REVIEW

The UX must prioritize speed over decoration.

The user should perform as little calculation as possible.

==================================================
1. MVP GAME PRESET
==================================================

Primary MVP preset:

Site: CoinPoker-style
Game: NLHE Cash
Table maximum: 6 seats
Primary stake preset: NL50
SB: 0.5 BB
BB: 1 BB
Starting/reference stack: 100 BB
Ante: 0.16 BB per dealt-in player when ante mode is enabled
Rake: 5%
Rake cap: 8 BB for the primary NL50 preset

Rake must be configurable.

Future presets such as NL100 must be possible mostly by changing the rake cap and monetary display configuration.

Represent the internal game in BB units.

IMPORTANT:
Do NOT use JavaScript floating point directly for core monetary accounting.

Use an integer fixed-point representation.

Recommended:
1 BB = 1000 milliBB

Examples:
100 BB = 100000
0.5 BB = 500
0.16 BB = 160
2.37 BB = 2370

All pot, stack, wager, contribution, rake, and settlement calculations must use the fixed-point unit.

Provide formatting/conversion utilities at the UI boundary.

