7. SESSION AND SEAT MODEL
==================================================

Table has six physical seats.

Seat state:

ACTIVE
SITTING_OUT
EMPTY

Hero seat remains visually fixed at bottom-center of the UI.

Physical seats do not rotate visually.

Button/position markers rotate.

