Sitting-out player:
- remains associated with the seat/player
- is excluded from the dealt-in hand
- does not post ante/blinds for that hand
- can return with one simple action

Because exact real-site missed-blind edge cases may differ:

provide manual BTN/SB/BB override tools.

Do not make unsupported assumptions invisible.

If fewer than six players are dealt in:

Poker Engine must still work.

GTO baseline V1 may initially support only six dealt-in players.

If exact GTO baseline is unavailable for a lineup:
- clearly indicate unavailable
- do not silently present a six-handed solution as exact
- optional approximate mode may be added later and must be visibly labeled

