10. HAND LIFECYCLE
==================================================

A poker "hand" means one full poker game/round.

Hand lifecycle:

NEW HAND
-> automatic button/blind/ante posting
-> Hero hole cards
-> PREFLOP
-> FLOP
-> TURN
-> RIVER
-> settlement/result
-> NEXT HAND

Street transitions should be automatic whenever Poker Engine can infer them.

Do not require a "Go to Flop" button if the betting round has naturally completed.

If flop is reached:
automatically request three board cards.

Turn:
request one card.

River:
request one card.

